Comment: 0,0:05:21.05,0:05:21.09,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,OPJP-location
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.88,0:05:25.05,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\bord4\blur4}拝啓最愛の日々へ
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.05,0:05:29.02,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\bord4\blur4}何処か懐かしく思えます
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.02,0:05:33.06,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\bord4\blur4}不自由なことばかりだった
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.06,0:05:40.44,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\bord4\blur4}あの日に帰りたい夜と雨
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.87,0:05:49.33,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\bord4\blur4}冷え切った指先で梳かす
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.33,0:05:52.08,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\bord4\blur4}濡れた髪と憧憬
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.08,0:05:59.59,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\bord4\blur4}何一つ不自由ない今日を疑ってしまう
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.01,0:06:04.51,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\bord4\blur4}軒下に立ち過ごした雨も
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.51,0:06:09.64,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\bord4\blur4}遠く手を振り近づく明かりも
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.77,0:06:15.44,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\bord4\blur4}あのねおかえりをまた言えたんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.44,0:06:18.57,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\bord4\blur4}ただいまって笑い合うんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.57,0:06:23.03,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\bord4\blur4}知らない日常も世界も言葉も
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.03,0:06:26.53,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\bord4\blur4}何故だろう暖かい
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.53,0:06:29.37,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\bord4\blur4}忘れなくてもいいよって
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.37,0:06:32.25,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\bord4\blur4}大切にしていいと
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.25,0:06:38.84,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\bord4\blur4}言ってくれたから独り想う夜
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.84,0:06:41.63,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\bord4\blur4}朝焼けと雨
Comment: 0,0:05:21.05,0:05:21.09,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,OPJP-location
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.88,0:05:25.05,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\bord4\blur4}致敬最愛的那些時光
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.05,0:05:29.02,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\bord4\blur4}總讓人懷念某些片刻
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.02,0:05:33.06,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\bord4\blur4}那些選擇滿是些身不由己
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.06,0:05:40.44,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\bord4\blur4}卻總想回到那天每當夜雨
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.87,0:05:49.33,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\bord4\blur4}冰涼的指尖輕柔梳理撫恤
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.33,0:05:52.08,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\bord4\blur4}被雨水打濕的頭髮與希冀
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.08,0:05:59.59,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\bord4\blur4}今日無憂無慮卻心生懷疑
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.01,0:06:04.51,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\bord4\blur4}曾經的日子在屋簷下躲雨
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.51,0:06:09.64,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\bord4\blur4}現逐漸走近燈火揮手遠去
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.77,0:06:15.44,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\bord4\blur4}我呀終於能再說出「你回來啦」
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.44,0:06:18.57,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\bord4\blur4}也能期待微笑回答「我回來啦」
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.57,0:06:23.03,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\bord4\blur4}全然陌生的日常、世界和語言
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.03,0:06:26.53,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\bord4\blur4}不知為何心暖四溢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.53,0:06:29.37,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\bord4\blur4}忘記與否無需在意
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.37,0:06:32.25,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\bord4\blur4}好好珍惜足夠可以
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.25,0:06:38.84,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\bord4\blur4}聽說「獨自思念在夜裡」
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.84,0:06:41.63,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\bord4\blur4}「朝霞便迎來細雨」
Comment: 0,0:22:10.02,0:22:10.06,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,EDJP-location
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.87,0:22:28.37,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}当たり前だと思っていた
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.37,0:22:31.41,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}この人生の色は
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.41,0:22:36.00,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}まだ知らない色彩で溢れていた
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.13,0:22:41.51,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}拙い言葉から滲み出す
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.51,0:22:44.51,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}奥底にしまった気持ち
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.51,0:22:48.14,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}振り返ってもいいんだって
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.14,0:22:52.02,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4}教えてくれた
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.02,0:22:55.27,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4\c&H010101&\1a&H00&\3c&HFFFFFF&}何気ない日常に
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.27,0:22:58.15,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4\c&H010101&\1a&H00&\3c&HFFFFFF&}やさしい愛を添えて
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.15,0:23:01.78,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur4\c&H010101&\1a&H00&\3c&HFFFFFF&}花ひとつ咲き誇る
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.36,0:23:06.36,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1860,520)\fad(240,240)\blur4\c&HFFFFFF&\fn@DFGPOP1-W5\frz-90\1a&H00&}雲がほどけた空に光る
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.36,0:23:10.74,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1860,520)\fad(240,240)\blur4\c&HFFFFFF&\fn@DFGPOP1-W5\frz-90\1a&H00&}心の熱を　覚えていたい
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.74,0:23:15.62,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1860,520)\fad(240,240)\blur4\c&HFFFFFF&\fn@DFGPOP1-W5\frz-90\1a&H00&}描く夢に見蕩れてる
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.62,0:23:22.38,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1840,520)\fad(240,240)\blur4\c&HFFFFFF&\fn@DFGPOP1-W5\frz-90\1a&H00&}数えきれない\N今日を貴方と飾り付ける
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.38,0:23:31.06,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1840,520)\fad(240,240)\blur4\c&HFFFFFF&\fn@DFGPOP1-W5\frz-90\1a&H00&}想い出はひとつずつ\N宝箱にしまうの
